# OlonJS Monorepo (npm-jpcore)

AI-native content infrastructure for Vercel & Vite. Deterministic, sovereign, git-backed.

## Monorepo layout (npm workspaces)

| Package | Path | npm name | Purpose |
|---------|------|----------|---------|
| **Core** | `packages/core` | `@olonjs/core` | Contract/kernel types, `$ref` resolution, theme flattening, WebMCP contracts, routing helpers — zero React |
| **React** | `packages/react` | `@olonjs/react` | `JsonPagesEngine`, rendering, theme runtime, HotSave |
| **Studio** | `packages/studio` | `@olonjs/studio` | Editor UI: `FormFactory`, `StudioStage`, Inspector |
| **Next** | `packages/next` | `@olonjs/next` | Next.js host binding (server loaders + `AdminIsland`) |
| **MCP** | `packages/mcp` | `@olonjs/mcp` | Local MCP bridge (Playwright → WebMCP) |
| **Sources** | `packages/sources` | `@olonjs/sources` | External collection sources + policy decorators |
| **CLI** | `packages/cli` | `@olonjs/cli` | Tenant scaffolding from DNA templates |
| **Stack** | `packages/stack` | `@olonjs/stack` | Version manifest for dependency alignment |
| **Compat** | `packages/jsonpages-{core,stack,cli}-compat` | `@jsonpages/*` | Rebrand compatibility bridges |
| **Tenant Alpha** | `apps/tenant-alpha` | — | Reference DNA template source (Vite) |
| **Tenant Next** | `apps/next` | — | Reference DNA template source (Next.js App Router) |
| **Landing** | `apps/olonjs.io` | — | Marketing site + canonical v1 JSON Schemas |

## Engine / Tenant split (fundamental invariant, post-ADR-0016)

The engine is three packages; the tenant owns everything else.

**Engine owns:** contract & resolution (`@olonjs/core`), routing + rendering engine (`@olonjs/react`), editor UI `/admin` + inspector + form factory (`@olonjs/studio`), Next server helpers (`@olonjs/next`).

**Tenant owns:** sections (components), schemas, type augmentation, page/config JSON data, theme/design layer, workflow scripts.

The tenant does NOT implement the CMS. It implements the tenant protocol consumed by the engine.

Boundary law (ADR-0016, enforced by `npm run test:boundary` → `scripts/check-package-boundaries.mjs`): core never imports react/studio; studio never imports react; react → studio only via the single dynamic import in `packages/react/src/engine/StudioRoute.tsx`.

## DNA generation (source of truth)

Template DNA is generated from source apps, never edited manually:

- `apps/tenant-alpha` -> `packages/cli/assets/templates/alpha/`
- `apps/next` -> `packages/cli/assets/templates/next/`

Commands:
- `npm run dist:dna:all` — regenerate all template DNA
- `npm run check:templates` — validate template conformance
- `npm run release:enterprise` — gated release (check + dist + publish)

## Build tools

- Vite 6 for library packages (`@olonjs/core`, `react`, `studio`, `sources`) and the Vite tenant apps
- Next.js 15 App Router for `apps/next`
- `@vitejs/plugin-react`, `vite-plugin-dts`, Tailwind CSS 4
- TypeScript ES2020 target, bundler module resolution
- Path alias: `@/*` -> `./src/*`

