## CLI usage

```
npx @olonjs/cli new tenant <name> [--template <name>]
```

Aliases: `olonjs` (primary), `jsonpages` (compatibility).

## Caveats

- On Windows UNC paths (`\\wsl.localhost\...`), npm/cmd may fail; use WSL shell.
- `scripts/release.js` pins workspace dependency versions during publish.
